# Blocklists pulled off a device for the offline probes. Third-party data, ~13 MB, and
# regenerated by `adb shell run-as io.omnishield cat files/filters/<name>` — see CLAUDE.md.
# The probe-*.txt fixtures next to them ARE checked in: they are the hostname lists the probes
# are run against, and they are what makes a coverage regression visible.
